  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nAn alien has kidnapped Matt Damon, not knowing what lengths humanity goes through to retrieve him whenever he goes missing.  \n\nThe alien has been looking for a new pet, a human, and he's found it in the form of Matt Damon.  Really, any human would have done but he just ran across Matt Damon first surrounded by a crowd of other humans.  \n\nThe alien takes Matt Damon to his ship and prepares to take him home.  Suddenly, his ship is buzzed by US fighter aircraft.  The alien is confused.  The puny jets are all around.  \"What is this?\" the alien asks.  A voice comes in over his comm system. \"This is the United States Air Force.  You have our revered citizen Matt Damon and we demand his immediate release.\"  The alien is shocked.  Hmmm, he muses I thought I had a human but this is a 'citizen, a Matt Damon'.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 12,
